Buffers:
GameScene.BackBuffer - the 3d game buffer
GameScene.UIBuffer - All of the UI elements

UIBlurEffect.BlurBuffer - A buffer scaled to 128, 72 that is downsampled to (using BackBuffer)
UIBlurEffect.UIBlurBuffer - An output buffer scaled to the same resolution as GameScene.BackBuffer & GameScene.UIBuffer

The stages are as follows:
- BackBuffer is downsampled to BlurBuffer using PSDownsample(VSOutput input)
- BlurBuffer is upsampled to UIBlurBuffer using PSUpsampleMasked(VSOutput input),
then masked using UIBuffer alpha (using something like if ceil(UIBuffer.a) == 1)

- UIBlurBuffer is rendered to screen.
